r", "M. Cassidy", "A. Hopkins,S. Turner"]}], "__class__": "Vote"}, "result": {"string": "Motion Passed (6 to 0)", "__class__": "MotionResult"}, "post_motion_texts": [], "__class__": "Motion"}], "items": {"1": {"title": "Draft Environmental Management Guidelines Update ", "number": "1", "content": [{"pre_motion_texts": [], "moved_by": {"string": "Moved by S. Turner", "__class__": "Mover"}, "seconded_by": {"string": "Seconded by A. Hopkins", "__class__": "Mover"}, "motion_texts": [{"string": "That, on the recommendation of the Director, City Planning and City Planner, the following actions be taken with respect to the Environmental Management Guidelines Update:", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"string": "a) the draft Environmental Management Guidelines (2020) appended to the staff report dated October 5, 2020 BE CIRCULATED for public review and comment: and,", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"string": "b) the members of external resource groups including EEPAC, First Nations communities, local Conservation Authorities (Upper Thames River, Lower Thames Valley and Kettle Creek Conservation Authorities), the London Home Builders Association, the London Development Institute, Nature London, and the Urban League BE THANKED for their work and comments during Pre-consultation and Phase 1 which helped guide the preparation of this initial draft.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "vote": {"rows": [], "__class__": "Vote"}, "result": {"string": "Motion Passed", "__class__": "MotionResult"}, "post_motion_texts": [], "__class__": "Motion"}], "items": {}, "datetime": "2020-10-05 16:00:00", "attachments": [{"empty_flag": false, "title": "2020-10-05 SR - Draft Environmental Management Guidelines Update - Full", "url": "https://pub-london.escribemeetings.com/filestream.ashx?DocumentId=76786", "date": "2020-10-05 00:00:00", "local_page": null, "__class__": "Attachment"}], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "2": {"title": "Building Division Monthly Report for August 2020", "number": "2",